{"id":"re_alite_","lemma":"réalité","pos":"noun","rank":886,"glosses":["reality; actuality; truth","realia, entity in the world"],"ipa":"/ʁe.a.li.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/60/Fr-r%C3%A9alit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9alit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"réalités"},"formAudio":{"réalités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9alit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La réalité est différente.","en":"The reality is different.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"}]},{"text":"Son rêve est devenu une réalité.","en":"His dream has become a reality.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"dream"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to become","l":"devenir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Que penses-tu en réalité ?","en":"What do you actually think?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"En réalité, je l'ai écrit.","en":"Actually, I did write it.","words":[{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to write","l":"écrire"}]},{"text":"C'est juste prendre ses rêves pour des réalités.","en":"That's just wishful thinking.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"dream","l":"rêve"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]}]}